  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Firefly III API 6.7.8 (6.7.4, 6.7.6 and 6.7.7 are included; upstream published no spec for 6.7.3 or 6.7.5). New: IChartsApi.GetChartBudgetOverviewWithLimits (/v1/chart/budget/overview-with-limits, 6.7.4), IAboutApi.GetReleaseNotes and GetCurrentReleaseNotes (/v1/release-notes/{version}, 6.7.8) returning the new ReleaseNotes model. New optional parameters: IAccountsApi.ListAccount active (6.7.4), IDataApi.DestroyData unused (6.7.7, a bool; the spec mis-types it as an int64 array). Categories: CategoryProperties gained Color and LastActivity, CategoryStore/CategoryUpdate gained Color (6.7.8). Constructors gained optional trailing parameters, so recompile against this version. Includes every 6.7.2.1 client fix.",
